{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涼みたいので\nまだ寒かったときの\n写真を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわ\n暑くなりそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもな\n春がもうすぐの\n朝のあのツンとした\n冬の香りがすきだったなあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"365日中\n350日くらいは頭が痛い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に\n梅雨入りした\n今はもっとだ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n今の時期は\nたいへん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n雨音は好き))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真みたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑いっぱいの場所を\n目的もなくあるくの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公園にいって\nひたすらぼーっと\nするのも好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外だね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていわれるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目でだいたい\n「この子はこういう子だろう」と\n判断しちゃうから\nめんどくさい\nギャップ凄すぎて説明が面倒だ))\nいっぱい知ろうと思ってくれた人にしか伝わんない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間テレビ\n46時間みてたら\n素の部分も少しは見えるだろうから\nザクッと知ってほしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり\nこのフィルムカメラで撮った\n小洒落た写真たちをみせたいので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小中学生のときとりあえず\n洒落たポエムを携帯の待受にしがち\nだったのを思い出して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洒落たポエマー風にかいてみたわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/09/0008725/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}